# SAIL VRS Backend — API Client (VS Code REST Client)
# Install the "REST Client" extension, open this file, click "Send Request".
#
# Port: 5001 by default on this machine (5000 is taken by another local
# project). Change @host if you set PORT=5000 in .env.

@host = http://localhost:5001
@adminToken = paste-admin-token-here
@employeeToken = paste-employee-token-here
@employeeId = EMP002
@applicationId = 1

### Health check (API + DB connectivity)
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Login — Admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "ADMIN001",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Login — Employee (executive, ACP OK)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "EMP002",
  "password": "Emp@123"
}

### Login — wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "EMP002",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Register employee (Admin only)
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "EMP010",
  "name": "New Executive",
  "department": "Production",
  "designation": "Deputy Manager",
  "designationType": "executive",
  "dateOfBirth": "1975-04-18",
  "dateOfJoining": "2001-07-01",
  "basicPay": 55000,
  "da": 18000,
  "role": "employee",
  "password": "Pass@123",
  "gradingHistory": [
    { "year": 2022, "grade": "A", "creditPoints": 44 },
    { "year": 2023, "grade": "B+", "creditPoints": 41 },
    { "year": 2024, "grade": "A", "creditPoints": 45 },
    { "year": 2025, "grade": "A", "creditPoints": 46 }
  ]
}

### Register employee — employee token (expect 403)
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "EMP011",
  "name": "Should Fail",
  "designationType": "non_executive",
  "dateOfBirth": "1980-01-01",
  "dateOfJoining": "2010-01-01",
  "basicPay": 40000,
  "da": 12000,
  "password": "Pass@123"
}

### List employees (Admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Employee profile + live eligibility / ACP / compensation
GET {{host}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Grading history
GET {{host}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}/grading-history
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Submit VRS application (Employee; 409 if one is already pending)
POST {{host}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### List applications
# Admin -> full FCFS queue (submitted_at ASC). Employee -> own applications.
GET {{host}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Application detail
GET {{host}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve application (Admin only)
PATCH {{host}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved"
}

### Reject application (Admin only)
PATCH {{host}}/api/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Rejected",
  "rejectionReason": "Insufficient service documents"
}

### Protected route without token (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/api/applications
